# Doctor fixture - CODEGEN-GO-IDENT-COLLISION-008.
# `enum status` lowers to the exported Go type `Status`; `query.lookup status`
# lowers to the exported wrapper func `Status`. Both land in the same
# `catalog` -> `cataloggen` Go package, so `go build` would reject the second
# declaration with "Status redeclared in this block". Doctor catches it first.

feature catalog
  domain
    enum status
      active
      archived

  resource Item
    org: Org required
    name: Text required
    status: status

  query.lookup status by id: ID
    policy @policy.authenticated
